    "careersEN": "Major employers include waste and water management companies such as REMONDIS and Veolia, as well as municipalities and government agencies. Surveys put typical starting gross salaries for engineering graduates in Germany at roughly EUR 45,000-55,000 per year, varying by specialization, region, and employer",
